This fixture contains GPT-6-Luna model metadata from OpenAI Codex.
Source: https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/codex-rs/models-manager/models.json
The accompanying openai-codex.LICENSE and openai-codex.NOTICE preserve its licensing and attribution.
The complete descriptor preserves the CLI's model instructions, reasoning settings, context limits, and tool contracts.

Two metadata values were changed for the proxy's standard Responses transport:
- use_responses_lite is false because Responses Lite omits hosted web search tools.
- tool_mode is direct because the proxy accepts standard Responses tool declarations.

The exact model slug remains gpt-6-luna.
These client settings do not establish whether the upstream provider supports hosted search.
